   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark romantic: low median (~78), warm brown shadows (46,32,24), red-orange dominant palette, saturation 0.35, deep warm skin (hue 24). Best for: Night and low-light couple portraits, candle-lit or lantern-lit frames, dramatic haveli interiors, red/maroon outfits. Avoid on flat bright daylight (use 02).</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
